{
  "description": "Evals of the LangGraph agent (services/agent). `python -m services.agent.record_evals` runs every case once against the real sources (knowledge base in Qdrant + 4Geeks gateway, Incidents Manager and inventory through the HealthCore MCP server) and stores the traces in data/eval/agent_eval_traces.json; tests/pipelines/test_agent_evals.py checks the criteria against those traces, without calling the models or the services again. `fault` injects a failure of the MCP server for that case only: `timeout` (an endpoint that accepts but never answers) or `down` (nothing listening).",
